        "docs/next_steps_rag_project_plan.md",
        "docs/current-progress.md",
        ".opencode/loop/execution-backlog.jsonc",
        ".opencode/loop/queue.json"
      ],
      "acceptance": [
        "Project docs clearly state external-source legality and crawl-courtesy boundaries.",
        "Policy baseline is explicit: public/no-login/no-paywall only; no access-control bypass; sitemap/sitemapindex is URL index, not an authorization grant; ingest only data you have rights to use.",
        "Existing source fetches gain narrow robots/domain or crawl-budget protections without broad connector redesign.",
        "Resync behavior stays biased toward incremental/low-disturbance refresh rather than repeated full-site pressure."
      ],
      "verification": [
